OL,3,GNEWSADundee City Council faces #4.1m
OL,4,Aoverspend this year
OL,5,
OL,6,FDundee City Council is facing a
OL,7,Fprojected overspend of more than #4m
OL,8,Fthis year as the local authority
OL,9,Fattempts to save money.
OL,11,FA new report has revealed that the
OL,12,Fcouncil overspend in its general fund
OL,13,Fhas risen by about #800,000 from last
OL,14,Fmonth's estimate.
OL,16,FIt means the council is expected to
OL,17,Fspend #4.1m more than it had budgeted
OL,18,Ffor this year, with some savings
OL,19,Ffailing to materialise and growing
OL,20,Fcosts in other areas.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
